hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1525","I am Abbas bin Muhammad al-Duri, Ishaq bin Mansour al-Saluli, Israel told us, on the authority of Simak, on the authority of Jabir bin Samra, he said: “It was The muezzin of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, would give the call to prayer, then he would delay, and when he saw that the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, had arrived, he would begin to stay.”"
